  "helpFaqReplyOtpLogin": "OTP login: enter your 10-digit mobile number and we send a verification OTP. Enter the 6-digit OTP to proceed.\n\nIf you don't receive it, wait for the resend timer and try again. Also confirm network/SMS permissions.",
